00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:08.270 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  [Music]  [Music]  it only took 10 years to bring the world  to the brink of collapse  this was a time where rising sea levels  collapsing economies  and broken alliances would transform  earth as we know it  in october 2033 the first ever category  6 hurricane occurred  hurricane sita and only a few months  later  in january 2034 the wide-scale fuel and  food shortages across the globe  led to a second great depression finally  in 2035 the european union officially  disbanded following germany's collapse  the world had become a hostile  environment everyone was out for  themselves  and a lot of previous alliances were  dissolved  a number of those who were left behind  needed to band together  in search of a safe place to exist  these people farmers doctors engineers  soldiers and a number of families who  had previously been worlds apart  were forced to join together in order to  survive  the media began to call them the  non-patrioted  they called themselves the no pets  by 2037 humanity had eventually begun to  adapt to this new way of life  and a number of revolutions in energy  desert irrigation  hydraulic levees and sea walls had  successfully reclaimed a lot of the  farmland previously lost  which enabled the rebuilding of supply  chains and this progress led to some of  the nations reopening their borders  however with no way of returning the 1.2  billion people back to their countries  of origin  the notepads became a permanent fixture  in all of the economic  military and social policy making  decisions  many of the notepads were still highly  distrustful of the governments that had  exiled them  and thus refused the invitation to  absorb themselves back into society  a number of no pet leaders emerged  inspiring a new identity  free from former nationality ties and  successfully draw a line in the sand  highlighting the difference between the  old world and the new world norms  we are no pets became a rallying cry  in 2040 a space storm knocked out over  70  of the world's satellites the subsequent  blackouts  caused mass devastation  planes crashed communications collapsed  and the global supply chains  once again came to a standstill as a  further result  the prices of grain oil and coal soared  thousands of lives were lost  with no internet no navigation no  surveillance  and no weather foresight the world has  lost some of its greatest tools in  communication  unsurprisingly geopolitical distrust  surged overnight  with no one able to spy on one another  they could also no longer  trust one another both russia and the us  came to a head  claiming the other was responsible for  the blackout while some suspected the no  pets were behind it  and accused them of trying to sow  anarchy  former military and combat trained  specialists among the nopats  rose up within the armed task forces in  a strategic move to defend themselves  as tensions continued to rise  it appeared that an all-out world war  was imminent  [Music]  with no other choice the no pets had to  choose sides  they were no longer fighting for a flag  but for their future survival  as expected the food and fuel shortages  only further ignited tensions  and a shadow war began where the  influences of russia and the united  states  helped to ignite the conflict between  other countries although they themselves  did very little fighting  to maintain plausible deniability both  sides fielded no pet task forces  as proxies and escalating conflicts over  resources  with the promise of giving them a piece  of what's left  the war between russia and the us fought  with no pet specialists and soldiers  took place across the globe  where both sides tried to maintain  control over vital resources  across a fractured earth  in battlefield 2042 the story narrative  will continue to be fed through the  battle pass seasons  and they'll be unique to those specific  time periods where the players are  present  additional law will also be found on the  maps as well as backstories for the  various characters  who all have their own origins that  align with the story  after collecting several parts of the  story things will slowly start coming  together  allowing you to understand the world and  the history of battlefield 2042  as already stated these battles will be  taking place all over the world  some of the locations that have been  revealed so far are  guyana where a battle takes place around  the site of an imminent rocket launch  [Music]  doha qatar a city that has been lost to  massive dust and sandstorms  brani island singapore tropical  tornadoes are a constant threat around  this vital american trade location  songdo south korea in this huge  metropolis  the fighting will occur between  skyscrapers and throughout the city  plazas  ylang india along a strategic section of  india's west coast  colossal ships stranded on the beach are  being stripped for parts  queen maudland antarctica oil extraction  has turned the freezing area into a  strategic hotspot  in the eastern desert of egypt through  the extreme conditions  a giant wall has been built to secure  rich man-made agricultural  areas  battlefield 2042 is set in a near future  fictitious yet real-world what-if  scenario  where the world is battling for survival  over the remaining resources  the remaining world superpowers are  utilizing soldiers who no longer have a  place they call home  to do their fighting for them with the  promise of something better if they were  to survive  i've spent a lot of time in battlefield  games over the years if by chance people  are interested in my slightly unorthodox  way of covering the game  awesome but either way i'll be playing  it regardless  anyway thank you very much for watching  and i'll catch you in the next one  cheers  attention all squads the russian troops  are falling back  [Applause]  we push them back but not far enough do  not let them regroup  you

